  m_text: 'Your goal is to survive the table. Each turn, select up to 3 cards to
    play face-down and declare a suit. You can play honestly, or you can lie!


    If
    an opponent calls ''CHEAT!'' on a lie, you take the penalty damage. If they accuse
    you and you were telling the truth, the damage backfires onto them! Keep an eye
    on your opponents'' Paranoia meters, the higher it gets, the more likely they
    are to call your bluff.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
